{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15928","headline":"寄崔列中丞 · 王建","name":"寄崔列中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火山无冷地，浊流无清源。\n人生在艰世，何处避谗言。\n诸侯镇九州，天子开四门。\n尚有忠义士，不得申其冤。\n嘉木移远植，爲我当行轩。\n君子居要途，易失主人恩。\n我爱古人道，师君直且温。\n贪泉誓不饮，邪路誓不奔。\n如何非冈坂，故使车轮翻。\n妓妾随他人，家事幸获存。\n当时门前客，默默空冤烦。\n从今遇明代，善恶亦须论。\n莫以曾见疑，直道遂不敦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}